"MAIN_POST pipes. Userspace selects which pipe to operate by setting the "
"**header.type** field to RPPX1_PARAMS_BLOCK_TYPE_HIST_PRE1, "
"RPPX1_PARAMS_BLOCK_TYPE_HIST_PRE2 or RPPX1_PARAMS_BLOCK_TYPE_HIST_POST."
msgstr ""

