"the **v_stepsize** and **h_step_inc** fields and by weighted windowing, by "
"programming the size of the measurement window **wnd** with **weights** "
"associated to each cell of the 5x5 measurement grid. Weights are represented "
"as 5 bits integer values ranging from 0 to 16."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../userspace-api/media/v4l/metafmt-rppx1:99:
#: ../include/uapi/linux/media/dreamchip/rppx1-config.h:312
