"of the **mode** field. When RPPX1_BLS_MODE_FIXED is used userspace shall "
"provide the per-channel black levels in **fixed**. When RPPX1_BLS_MODE_MEAS "
"is used userspace shall configure the measurement windows **window1** and "
"optionally **window2** to select the optically black pixels region in the "
"input frame. The **samples** fields controls how many measure samples are "
"used for averaging the measured black levels."
msgstr ""

